{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2023-01-04 09:25:00', 'title': "TOM'S OF MAINE ANNOUNCES 2022 INCUBATOR MEMBERS: FIVE RISING ENVIRONMENTAL LEADERS EACH AWARDED $20K TO SUPPORT THEIR WORK", 'text': "KENNEBUNK, MAINE , JAN. 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TOM'S OF MAINE TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FIVE WINNING MEMBERS OF THE 2022 TOM'S OF MAINE INCUBATOR , INCLUDING ALIYAH COLLINS (24), WAWA GATHERU (24), ALEXIA LECLERCQ (22), BODHI PATIL (20), AND SANJANA PAUL (25). \xa0 EACH RECIPIENT HAS BEEN AWARDED $20,000 IN FUNDING TO HELP SUPPORT THEIR WORK, PLUS ACCESS TO EXPERT MENTORS AND OPPORTUNITIES TO COLLABORATE WITH AND RECEIVE SUPPORT FROM TOM'S OF MAINE IN AMPLIFYING THEIR WORK IN SUSTAINABILITY."}